; ChassisSim Engine component definition for the minimal engine_map debug DLL.
;
; Bound by symbol name: InputVarName / OutputVarName are the exported global
; struct instances and FunctionName is the exported step function (all extern "C"
; in engine_map.cpp). InitFnFlg=0 means no initialize call is made, so
; InitFuncName is left blank.
;
; InputVarN / OutputVarN are positional: InputVar0 maps the first field of
; engine_map_in_t to the Engine signal index given as its value, InputVar1 the
; second, and so on. The struct field order in engine_map.h matches this list.
;
; Filename is intentionally blank -- fill it in with the real path to
; engine_map.dll.

